{
  "name": "CreateVdcUser",
  "summary": "创建VDC用户",
  "tags": "VDC",
  "productshort": "ManageOneSCHCS",
  "region_id": "ap-southeast-3",
  "paths": {
    "/rest/vdc/v3.2/vdcs/{vdc_id}/users": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "创建VDC用户",
        "x-resource": "用户管理",
        "description": "创建VDC用户。\n\ncurl命令调用示例:\n```\ncurl -v -H \"Content-Type:application/json\" -H \"x-auth-token: ******\" -X POST -d \"{json}\" \"https://{endpoint}/rest/vdc/v3.2/vdcs/{vdc_id}/users\"\n```\n\n|SLA项|定义|\n|-----|-----|\n|请求成功率| >=99.9%|\n|可用性|Tier1|\n|数据一致性|最终一致,不一致时长<1分钟|\n|吞吐量|60次/分钟|\n|吞吐量|10次/秒|\n|TP50请求时延|2500ms|\n|TP99.9请求时延|5000ms|",
        "tags": [
          "VDC"
        ],
        "operationId": "CreateVdcUser",
        "produces": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "consumes": [
          "application/json"
        ],
        "parameters": [
          {
            "name": "x-auth-token",
            "in": "header",
            "required": true,
            "type": "string",
            "description": "接口支持的用户token。运营管理员,VDC管理员权限,机机账号权限,代维管理员权限用户的token。"
          },
          {
            "name": "vdc_id",
            "type": "string",
            "in": "path",
            "required": true,
            "description": "VDC id,只能包含小写字母、数字、中划线,长度在1-36之间。"
          },
          {
            "name": "createVdcUserRequest",
            "in": "body",
            "description": "创建VDC用户请求体。",
            "required": true,
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/CreateVdcUserRequest"
            }
          }
        ],
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "创建VDC用户成功。",
            "schema": {
              "$ref": "#/definitions/QueryVdcUserResponse"
            },
            "examples": {
              "application/json": {
                "user": {
                  "id": "682a21734f2545ff9dbc27921b55e609",
                  "domain_id": "ed089c22886c47d29549513c7c204cd6",
                  "domain_name": "domain1",
                  "name": "vdcuser776",
                  "display_name": "",
                  "enabled": true,
                  "description": null,
